 <div class="gotg-hero text-white py-5"> <div class="container"> <div class="text-uppercase small gotg-gold mb-1">Who we are</div> <h1 class="display-6 fw-bold">About Gift of the Givers</h1> <p class="lead">Coordinating disaster relief — tracking incidents, relief centres, resources, volunteers, and donations in one place.</p> </div> </div> <div class="container py-5"> <div class="row g-4"> <div class="col-md-4"> <h2 class="h5">Our mission</h2> <p class="text-muted">To respond quickly and transparently to disasters — floods, fires, and droughts — by connecting donors, volunteers, and relief centres.</p> </div> <div class="col-md-4"> <h2 class="h5">How it works</h2> <p class="text-muted">Employees track live incidents and relief centre capacity. Volunteers sign up and get assigned roles. Donors contribute and receive a placeholder tax certificate.</p> </div> <div class="col-md-4"> <h2 class="h5">Get involved</h2> <p class="text-muted"> <a asp-controller="Volunteers" asp-action="Index">Sign up to volunteer</a> or <a asp-controller="Donations" asp-action="Index">make a donation</a> to support current response efforts. </p> </div> </div> </div>